☐ Task 3: The Main Menu State (Unauthenticated)
☐ Task 3.1: Create runMainMenu(). Use runInteractiveMenu to display: [ "Login", "Register Account", "Quit" ].
☐ Task 3.2: Implement Registration Flow. Ask for Name, Bday, Contact, PIN, and Drive Letter one by one. If the user presses ESC on any step, return to Main Menu. Evaluate the return code (0, 1, 2, 3) from atm.registerAccount() and print the specific error (e.g., "Drive Invalid" or "Account Exists") without wiping their typed data.
